67em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></em> </p>\n</blockquote>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Tue, Oct 13th @ 12:46 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:16</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>",
